---
// Layout
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Acerca de"
  description="Descubre la técnica Pomodoro y cómo nuestra aplicación te ayuda a maximizar tu productividad con sesiones de enfoque profundo."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16 py-4">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="text-center space-y-4 py-8">
      <div class="text-6xl mb-2">🍅</div>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-foreground dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        La Técnica Pomodoro
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Un método simple pero poderoso para mejorar tu concentración y
        productividad.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- What is Pomodoro -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        ¿Qué es la Técnica Pomodoro?
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">
          La Técnica Pomodoro fue creada por <span
            class="font-semibold text-primary">Francesco Cirillo</span
          > a finales de los años 80. El nombre proviene del temporizador de cocina
          con forma de tomate (pomodoro en italiano) que usó durante la universidad.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">
          Esta técnica divide el trabajo en intervalos de <span
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary"
          >25 minutos</span> llamados "pomodoros", separados por breves descansos. Es perfecta para
          combatir la procrastinación y mantener el enfoque.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it Works -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        ¿Cómo Funciona?
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">1</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Elige una tarea</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Selecciona la tarea en la que quieres trabajar. Puede ser
            cualquier cosa: estudiar, programar, escribir, diseñar...
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">2</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Trabaja 25 minutos</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Concéntrate completamente en tu tarea durante 25 minutos. Sin
            distracciones, sin redes sociales, sin multitarea.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">3</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Descansa 5 minutos</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Toma un descanso corto. Levántate, estírate, toma agua. Deja que
            tu mente se relaje.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">4</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Repite y descansa largo</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Después de 4 pomodoros, toma un descanso más largo de 15-30
            minutos. ¡Te lo has ganado!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- App Features -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Características de la App
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">
            Temporizador Inteligente
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Alterna automáticamente entre trabajo y descanso. Configura tu
            tiempo disponible y comienza.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path>
              <path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Notificaciones</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Recibe alertas sonoras cuando termine cada sesión. Nunca pierda el
            ritmo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M3 3v18h18"></path>
              <path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">
            Estadísticas Detalladas
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Visualiza tu rendimiento semanal y diario. Mira cuánto tiempo real
            dedicas a cada tarea.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path
                d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Multiidioma</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Disponible en español e inglés. Cambia el idioma cuando quieras.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Responsive</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Funciona perfectamente en móvil, tablet y escritorio. Lleva tu
            productividad a todas partes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path
                d="M19 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"
              ></path>
              <polyline points="17 21 17 13 7 13 7 21"></polyline>
              <polyline points="7 3 7 8 15 8"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Historial y Datos</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Guarda tu progreso automáticamente. Analiza tus sesiones y mantén
            la constancia en el tiempo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Beneficios de Usar Pomodoro
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Mejora la concentración</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Los intervalos cortos te ayudan a mantener el enfoque sin agotarte
              mentalmente.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m12 14 4-4"></path>
              <path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Reduce la procrastinación</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              25 minutos es un compromiso manejable. Es más fácil empezar cuando
              sabes que es temporal.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path
                d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3-4-4-6.5c-1 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5s-3 3.5-3 5.5a7 7 0 0 0 7 7Z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Previene el burnout</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Los descansos regulares evitan el agotamiento y mantienen tu
              energía alta.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Aumenta la productividad</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Trabajar en sprints cortos te hace más eficiente y consciente del
              tiempo.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="text-center py-6">
      <div
        class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/10 via-card to-card border border-border/60 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          ¿Listo para ser más productivo?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Comienza tu primer Pomodoro ahora y experimenta la diferencia en tu flujo de trabajo.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-3">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02]"
          >
            Comenzar Ahora
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="h-4 w-4"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
